---

> **NurseWebSite:** *Professional presentation and direct contact landing page for an independent pediatric nurse — built for real patients and families.*

> 🩺 **Client Project.** A lightweight, high-performance single-page site crafted entirely in **Vanilla JavaScript** — no frameworks, no build tools, no overhead.
> Designed to present a professional pediatric nurse profile with clarity and warmth, enabling families to learn about her services and reach out with zero friction.
>
> *Clean · Fast · Human · Built in Bogotá 🇨🇴*

---

## 🩺 About the Project

**NurseWebSite** is a professional landing page built for a real client — an independent pediatric nurse — to establish her digital presence and give patients and families a direct, trustworthy way to contact her.

The site was engineered with **zero external dependencies**: pure HTML5, CSS3, and Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+). This keeps it lightning-fast, infinitely portable, and trivially easy to maintain or hand off.

| What | Why |
| :--- | :--- |
| 👩‍⚕️ Professional profile section | Establishes credibility and trust with families |
| 📩 Direct contact section | Zero-friction patient outreach |
| 📱 Fully responsive layout | Seamless on phone, tablet, and desktop |
| ⚡ Zero-dependency build | No npm, no bundler, no runtime — just open and run |
| 🌐 Netlify CI/CD | Auto-deploy on every `git push` |

