## 🎨 Design System

> Warm, professional, and accessible — built around trust and clarity for families seeking pediatric care.

<div align="center">

| Token | Hex | Role |
| :---- | :-- | :--- |
| 🩵 Sky Blue | `#A8DADC` | Primary accent · Calm & medical |
| 🌊 Deep Navy | `#1D3557` | Headings · Authority & trust |
| 💙 Soft Teal | `#457B9D` | Secondary text · Professional warmth |
| ⬜ Clinical White | `#FFFFFF` | Base background · Clean feel |
| 🟢 Action Green | `#00D26A` | Live status · CTA elements |

</div>

| Principle | Implementation |
| :-------- | :------------- |
| 💙 **Warmth** | Soft palette — not clinical white, not cold blue |
| 🔤 **Legibility** | High-contrast text, generous line-height for all ages |
| 📱 **Mobile-first** | Designed at 375px, scaled up |
| ♿ **Accessibility** | Semantic HTML, meaningful alt text, tab-navigable |

