## 📂 Project Structure

```text
PediatricNurseCare/                 ← Repository Root
│
├── 📄 index.html                   ← Single entry point · Semantic HTML5
│
├── 🎨 css/
│   └── styles.css                  ← Global styles · Responsive breakpoints
│
├── ⚡ js/
│   └── main.js                     ← Vanilla JS · DOM logic · Interactions
│
├── 🖼️ assets/
│   ├── images/                     ← Profile photos · Icons · Brand imagery
│   └── fonts/                      ← Local or linked web fonts
│
└── 📖 README.md
```

