## ⚙️ Getting Started

No build tools. No `npm install`. No configuration. Just clone and open.

### Prerequisites

- A modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)
- Git — to clone the repo

### Clone & Run

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/NietoDeveloper/PediatricNurseCare.git

# 2. Navigate into the project
cd PediatricNurseCare

# 3. Open directly in your browser — that's it
open index.html        # macOS
xdg-open index.html    # Linux
start index.html       # Windows
```

### Live Server (optional, for development)

```bash
# Using npx — no global install needed
npx serve .

# Or VS Code → right-click index.html → "Open with Live Server"
```

