## 🌐 Deployment

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  DEPLOY PIPELINE                        │
│                                                         │
│  git push origin main                                   │
│       │                                                 │
│       └──► Netlify detects push                         │
│            ├── Builds in ~5s (static — instant)         │
│            ├── Deploys to global CDN                    │
│            └── Live at monicaandramunio.netlify.app ✅  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

| Environment | URL |
| :---------- | :-- |
| **Production** | [monicaandramunio.netlify.app](https://monicaandramunio.netlify.app/) |
| **Local dev** | `index.html` direct · or `localhost:3000` via Live Server |

