## ✨ Core Features

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A([👩‍⚕️ Nurse Profile]) -->|Clear presentation| B[Professional Bio]
    B -->|Builds trust| C[Services Overview]
    C -->|Enables action| D[Contact Section]
    D -->|Direct outreach| E([💌 Patient & Family])

    style A fill:#A8DADC,color:#000,stroke:#1D3557
    style B fill:#457B9D,color:#fff,stroke:#1D3557
    style C fill:#457B9D,color:#fff,stroke:#1D3557
    style D fill:#1D3557,color:#fff,stroke:#A8DADC
    style E fill:#A8DADC,color:#000,stroke:#1D3557
```

| Feature | Description |
| :------ | :---------- |
| 👩‍⚕️ **Professional Profile** | Full bio, credentials, and pediatric specialization |
| 📋 **Services Section** | Clear, readable overview of what she offers |
| 📩 **Contact Section** | Direct CTA for families to reach out |
| 📱 **Responsive Design** | Flawless on mobile — where most parents browse |
| ⚡ **Instant Load** | No JS bundle, no framework overhead |
| 🌐 **Always Online** | Netlify global CDN · 99.9% uptime |

